el=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#465</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fix some bugs with MySQL strict mode <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/464\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#464</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fix release template editor <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/463\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#463</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fix multiple variable cleanup in private messaging <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/462\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#462</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fix magnet link passkey creation for new users <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/461\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#461</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Update required PHP version to 7.1.3 <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/460\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#460</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/Exileum\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Exileum</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Split funct